{# Fan chart: 3 days, 80% band (q10-q90), 50% band (q25-q75), median line, category threshold rules.

Context contract (every variable is validated before rendering):
  bulletin.horizons
  geometry: output of visualization/fan_chart.py (pure data: points and paths)

Regions:
  - <svg role='img' aria-labelledby> with <title>/<desc> from t('a11y.chart_alt')
